              "NET RESULT: vendor/box3d/box3d.wasm is 973,188 -> 829,117 bytes (14.8% SMALLER) while exporting 32 MORE functions (45 -> 77 swk_*) -- wasm-opt's dead-code elimination over the larger, more-complete link more than paid for the added surface. Sensors, wheel joints, and swk_world_cast_ray are now live in the browser build for the first time; nothing consumes them yet (sensorTrigger.mjs and the wheel/ray gates exercise them directly, but no gameplay system is wired to swk_sensor_begin/swk_wheel_spin/swk_world_cast_ray outside the selfchecks) -- that wiring is a separate, future round, not claimed here.",
